ease reject the application if this isn't allowed. If you could provide a transparent image that would be really helpful!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1IcqZxAPnAqdV8r6QwsaXIlS82zN9vTJR", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mogringer/works/52", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/68cfb19a/uploads/origins/2c44dc10-42c3-4d0d-9bf3-6bc6c7d0b451?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ac735b117df8ca2ed26f97d2dabab3c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/68cfb19a/uploads/origins/2c44dc10-42c3-4d0d-9bf3-6bc6c7d0b451?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ac735b117df8ca2ed26f97d2dabab3c, https://si.imgix.net/68cfb19a/uploads/origins/2c44dc10-42c3-4d0d-9bf3-6bc6c7d0b451?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e312a8fd99134f4327b47c8ecafee5a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/68cfb19a/uploads/origins/2c44dc10-42c3-4d0d-9bf3-6bc6c7d0b451?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=232b40e48b8892c729b1a66ffa0ef719 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "自分のキャラクターのアートを手に入れたい。\n\n彼女が花に飛びつくような絵をお願いします。\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://trello.com/c/ARyPE4N0/3-green", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mogringer/works/51", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0eca5bc2/uploads/origins/6657d5ff-2786-46eb-b561-90349c14f21e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a3a126a75298884fcb0797b1bf82c4b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0eca5bc2/uploads/origins/6657d5ff-2786-46eb-b561-90349c14f21e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a3a126a75298884fcb0797b1bf82c4b, https://si.imgix.net/0eca5bc2/uploads/origins/6657d5ff-2786-46eb-b561-90349c14f21e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00bd9b14e4eaf58a0196ef366123c44b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0eca5bc2/uploads/origins/6657d5ff-2786-46eb-b561-9034